One of my three VAXen is ill. The DSSI disks started to behave
erratically (resetting for no obvious reason, disconnections,
failures...). I've diagnosed the problem and now I know the flat
50-wire cable which links the CPU embedded controller to the two DSSI
disks and the external DSSI connector is broken.

